1
00:00:00,906 --> 00:00:03,246
(Leonard:)- What?
- Sheldon's onion ring. Just put it back.

2
00:00:03,617 --> 00:00:06,247
- It's one onion ring.
- Just put it back before he comes.

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,870
(Leonard:)Don't think that's where it was.

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,750
(Howard:)Okay, here he comes.
Deny, deny, deny, people. Wall of silence.

5
00:00:17,173 --> 00:00:20,013
- Who touched my...?
- Penny. Penny did it.

6
00:00:22,595 --> 00:00:23,885
(Sheldon:)Why would you do that?

7
00:00:24,055 --> 00:00:26,305
(Penny:)I don't know. I was hungry?
What's the big deal?

8
00:00:26,474 --> 00:00:29,894
(Penny:)The big deal
is that nobody touches food on my plate.

9
00:00:30,061 --> 00:00:31,771
All right. I didn't know. I'm sorry.

10
00:00:31,937 --> 00:00:35,227
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm sorry,
but that is your second strike.

11
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:41,070
(Leonard:)- What?
- You have two strikes.

12
00:00:41,238 --> 00:00:43,158
(Sheldon:)Three strikes and you're out.

13
00:00:44,867 --> 00:00:46,907
(Sheldon:)It's a sports metaphor.

14
00:00:47,828 --> 00:00:49,618
- A sports metaphor?
- Yes, baseball.

15
00:00:53,042 --> 00:00:54,622
(Penny:)All right, yeah, I'll play along.

16
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:56,754
(Penny:)- What was my first strike?
- March 18th.

17
00:00:56,921 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)You violated my rule
about forwarding e-mail humor.

